{
  "_comment": [
    "sg13g2-bandgap -- `klt sim` request template for sg13cmos5l-closed-loop-startup-pex (issue #337, Part of #322).",
    "Same grid and measurements as the legacy run_pvt_sweep.sh loop; instantiated by run_klt_sim.sh via",
    "sim/harness/cmos5l_klt.py, which substitutes @@BODY@@ and @@CORNER_BUNDLE@@ (local sanity) or splits per",
    "process x supply (batch).",
    "",
    "NO SUPPLY AXIS, ON PURPOSE. The rail is a PWL ramp whose target is baked into the body (@@VDD@@); `alter`",
    "would clobber it (klt refuses a supply axis on a transient-waveform source). The grid's supplies {2.97, 3.30,",
    "3.63} V are cmos5l_klt.py SUPPLIES, one request per (process, supply) with 3 temperatures each; the",
    "adapter's corner-id grammar needs one supply token, so `enrich --kind closed-loop` injects the baked ramp",
    "target from each corner's deck (sim/harness/enrich_pvt_report.py inject_baked_supply).",
    "",
    "Measurement names are the legacy CSV column names (det_early_v ... i_mkfb_final_a); the legacy `.control`",
    "`meas tran v_* find ... at=` cards are carried over one for one, early check at 20 us and the settled",
    "closed-loop state at 2 ms (the tran end point). dvsns_final_v and the verdict are added by",
    "`cmos5l_klt.py enrich --kind closed-loop` (they are differences/predicates over 6-s.f. reported values;",
    "the legacy script computed them the same way, post hoc, with awk)."
  ],
  "engine": "ngspice",
  "netlist": "@@BODY@@",
  "netlist_source": "extracted",
  "models": {
    "lib": "@@CORNER_BUNDLE@@"
  },
  "corners": {
    "process": [
      "typ",
      "bcs",
      "wcs",
      "sf",
      "fs"
    ],
    "temperature_c": [
      -40,
      27,
      125
    ]
  },
  "analysis": {
    "kind": "tran",
    "args": "2u 2m"
  },
  "measurements": [
    {
      "name": "det_early_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran det_early_v find v(det) at=20u"
    },
    {
      "name": "fb_early_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran fb_early_v find v(fb) at=20u"
    },
    {
      "name": "fb_final_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran fb_final_v find v(fb) at=2m"
    },
    {
      "name": "sns1_final_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran sns1_final_v find v(sns1) at=2m"
    },
    {
      "name": "sns2_final_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran sns2_final_v find v(sns2) at=2m"
    },
    {
      "name": "vref_final_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran vref_final_v find v(vref) at=2m"
    },
    {
      "name": "det_final_v",
      "spice": ".meas tran det_final_v find v(det) at=2m"
    },
    {
      "name": "i_mkfb_final_a",
      "spice": ".meas tran i_mkfb_final_a find i(Vmkfb) at=2m"
    }
  ],
  "options": {
    "timeout_s": 600,
    "keep_artifacts": true
  }
}
